<QFT version="4" name="DC motor, Tharewal 3.3" description="Example 3.3 of Tharewal 2005: the DC motor k a/(s(s+a)) with a first-order tracking corridor. The published controller has a complex pole pair, which this search cannot take, so the file carries one zero and one pole. The design meets the stability margin at every frequency, not only at the five design ones." doi="10.1115/1.2397147">
